Subject: Cantor M2B Pure Windows Entry Policy Justification

& [JustificationIdentity] is traceable
  + [justification_uuid] is fdcf50e8-685e-404d-ab55-0011b8650604

& [WhyNow] is dependency reduction
  + the scanner cannot safely decide descent or content admission until supplied metadata has a closed policy interpretation
  + encoding that interpretation in safe pure Rust makes later Windows calls data suppliers rather than policy owners
  + pure exhaustive tests can find truth-table and namespace errors without constructing adversarial filesystem objects

& [WhyNotBroader] is safety
  + physical metadata completeness, enumeration, traversal, stream interpretation, and Git reconciliation require later authorities and fixtures
  + Unicode normalization is excluded because no collision semantics have been selected
  + regular executable mode is excluded because Windows attributes do not establish Git executable intent

& [Cost] is bounded
  + one source module and one library export
  + zero dependency, lockfile, unsafe, state, and migration delta

& [Rollback] is direct
  + remove the module and export
  + retain source, SJS, solution, proof, and fault history
